<p style="text-align: justify;">These are homework exercises to accompany the Textmap created for<a title="Textbook_Maps/General_Chemistry_Textbook_Maps/Map%3A_Principles_of_Modern_Chemistry_(Oxtoby_et_al.)" href="https://chem.libretexts.org/Bookshelves/General_Chemistry/Map%3A_Principles_of_Modern_Chemistry_(Oxtoby_et_al.)" rel="internal"> &quot;</a><span class="title mt-title-edit"><a title="Textbook_Maps/General_Chemistry_Textbook_Maps/Map%3A_Principles_of_Modern_Chemistry_(Oxtoby_et_al.)" href="https://chem.libretexts.org/Bookshelves/General_Chemistry/Map%3A_Principles_of_Modern_Chemistry_(Oxtoby_et_al.)" rel="internal">Principles of Modern Chemistry&quot; by Oxtoby et al.</a></span> Complementary General Chemistry question banks can be found for other Textmaps and can be accessed <a title="Homework_Exercises/Exercises%3A_General_Chemistry" href="https://chem.libretexts.org/Bookshelves/General_Chemistry/Exercises%3A_General_Chemistry" rel="internal">here</a>.</p>
